title: '? The builder can fold in the readings without a revision mission.'
pid: 4596c363-1b88-4f2a-873e-30a360304815
body: |2-
  Trial: the next plan whose readings ask for real changes. Afterward
  Libby reads the plan as built; if it contradicts itself, a short
  revision mission by the author is worth adding. First use: Vic
  folded in Tay's, Libby's and Drew's findings in the mission that
  built part 2; nobody has yet read the plan as built.
